    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "President Warren G. Harding declared the area a national monument in 1923, and Congress redesignated it a national park in 1928.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bryce_Canyon_National_Park"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Early 20th‑century Union Pacific and Santa Fe railroads promoted the canyon in 1916 magazine articles, sparking tourist interest.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
